<title>HUNGARY: COFINEC GROUP IAS Q1 '97 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</title>
<headline>COFINEC GROUP IAS Q1 '97 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	    11.7     vs     15.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		 5.7     vs	7.2</p>
<p>    Group net sales		    183.7     vs    172.7</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	    144.4     vs    131.0</p>
<p>    Operating costs		    23.8	vs    21.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  2.3	vs     2.2</p>
<p>    Net other income		    1.6 loss vs     2.1 loss</p>
<p>    Interest revenue		    0.7	vs     0.7</p>
<p>    Interest expenditure		5.8	vs     7.8</p>
<p>    Net exchange rate income	  0.9 loss vs     1.6 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation				0.8	vs     0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Cofinec is a packaging company, registered in</p>
<p>France. The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were</p>
<p>calculated in accordance with International Accounting</p>
<p>Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
